cument only for #7).\n- Unknown model: allow-list message vs cursor stderr catalog (#4 probe) — **Ruling:** stderr lists all configured ids.\n- Empty stdin/`--prompt-file` — **Ruling:** validation error, exit 2.\n\n**4. Acceptance vs spec/code**\n- E2E must hit `delegate` binary; `tests/e2e.rs` drives MCP only — **Ruling:** new CLI e2e; keep MCP green.\n- “Valid ids” vs `ModelNotAllowedError` wording — **Ruling:** enumerate ids on stderr.\n- “Print once terminal” vs timeout with RUNNING jobs — **Ruling:** print last snapshot; non-zero exit.\n- Fixtures via recording script while #7 blocked on #6 — **Ruling:** land #6 fixtures before asserting streams.\n\nSTATUS: DONE_WITH_CONCERNS","session_id":"36627d89-4873-4238-8376-e9782bc73a39","request_id":"1980f2fa-bcff-4397-b8a1-23601c4723d6","usage":{"inputTokens":39725,"outputTokens":3667,"cacheReadTokens":217518,"cacheWriteTokens":0}}
